--- OLD
  : LDA lut_MagicBattleMessages, X  ; Get the desired message to print
    BEQ @DelayAndExit               ; if 0, don't print anything.  Instead, just delay and exit
--- NEW
.export lut_MagicBattleMessages
.import opt_magicmsg

    ;  The same byte, except that LIFE and LIF2 carry BTLMSG_INEFFECTIVENOW --
    ;  which was true until Cast Life made them work.  With the flag on they
    ;  carry 0 instead, which is what PURE and LAMP carry: say nothing here and
    ;  let the ailment message do the talking.  See opt_magicmsg.
  : JSL opt_magicmsg + OPTFAR       ; Get the desired message to print
    BEQ @DelayAndExit               ; if 0, don't print anything.  Instead, just delay and exit
